      "natural_statement": "For all k and nonzero n, Main.lean factorizations k n is exactly the ordered natural-number k-tuples with product n and has cardinality at most k^Omega(n). For arbitrary two slot counts at most k, their Cartesian product has cardinality at most k^(Omega(n)+Omega(nprime)). Ordered unequal collision-pair cardinality is monotone under a closed value-endpoint restriction.",
